    examples/train/*.dsl            (full-v1-batch-1.dsl renders the data of
                                     models/railway-batch-1.xmi; the others
                                     are projections of railway.xcore)
    examples/running-example/*.dsl  (the Train v1.0 structural profile with
                                     authored objects)
