is also EPL-1.0, is fetched the same way and is not included either.

================================================================================
OMG specifications (not included)
================================================================================

The MOF 2.5.1 and UML 2.5 specifications and their machine-readable files
(MOF.xmi, UML.xmi, PrimitiveTypes.xmi, EMOFConstraints.ocl) are copyright of
the Object Management Group and its member companies. OMG's terms do not permit
posting them on a network computer or distributing modified copies, so they are
not in this repository. `make sources` (scripts/sources.py) downloads them from
omg.org into the ignored directory sources/raw/ and verifies their SHA-256
digests against sources/manifest.json. Text extracted from them by `make text`
also stays in an ignored directory.

VL-MOF formalizes a structural subset of EMOF and is based on these
specifications; it does not claim OMG compliance or conformance. MOF, UML, XMI
and OMG are trademarks of the Object Management Group, Inc.

